{
  "name": "dsh-graceful-restart",
  "version": "0.4.0",
  "description": "DSH（DeepSeek Harness）优雅重启/关闭/启动守护插件：启动方式不变（dsh web），自动套壳拉起正式实例；等轮次结束后优雅重启并唤醒智能体继续；两阶段统一故障判断（启动阶段退出码/宽限期 + 刷新阶段第二代自检连接就绪与会话恢复），失败自动回滚（纯指针快照链、无限逐级回滚、双向差集逆操作、独立错误记录）；页面自动刷新。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    },
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node test/sandbox-test.mjs"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
